.nh
.TH "PB-RECORDINGS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-recordings - List and replay team terminal recordings


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb recordings [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List and replay team terminal recordings

.PP
List the team terminal recordings you may see, start or stop recording a session you are attached to, and replay or export one from the machine that recorded it. Each replay is audited first; the recording key opens with your unlocked vault on this computer.

.PP
With --json, this command group lists its available commands.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for recordings


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-export(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-list(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-play(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-start(1)\fP, \fBpb-recordings-stop(1)\fP
